  "prefLabel": "Tra 501.09 Waiver of Consultant Selection Process in Case of Emergency",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Tra 501.09 Waiver of Consultant Selection Process in Case of Emergency. If a municipality is in immediate need of bridge construction or reconstruction as a result of an emergency, the bureau shall waive the consultant selection process if the municipality:\n\n(a) Has municipal staff qualified to provide the services; or\n\n(b) Has in place a contract for services, reached through a process complying with RSA 21-I:22, with a firm qualified to provide the required design services, provided that all firms that competed for selection to provide those services were qualified to provide the required design services.\n\nSource. #8923, eff 6-27-07; ss by #11037, eff 2-22-16",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/tra500.html"
}
